sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Booking API
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant R as Outbox Relay
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant C as Consumers
  B->>DB: UPDATE booking + INSERT outbox (1 transacción)
  R->>DB: lee filas sin publicar
  R->>MQ: publish + confirm
  R->>DB: published_at
  MQ->>C: entrega
  C->>DB: event_id + efecto (1 transacción)
  C->>MQ: ACK
